 <h3><u>Jo Haider e karrar hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>JO HAIDERE KARAAR HAI<br> WOH KUL KA MADADGAR HAI <br> USSE HAME BHI PYAAR HAI<br> HO NAARA ALI<br> <br> MARHAB KO DO TUKDE KIA <br> KHAIBER KO HATHO PAR RAKHA<br> JIBREEL DETE THE SADA <span class=text_exposed_show><br> MUSHKIL KUSHA AI MUSHKIL KUSHA<br> MAULA TUMHARE WAAR SE KATNME LAGE HAI PAR MERE<br> MUSHKIL KUSHAI KIJIYE<br> <br> KHAIBER HO YAA JANGE JAMAL<br> SAB MUSHKILO KA EK HAL<br> HAIDER KA JO BHI KAAM HAI<br> HAYYA ALAA KHAIRIL AMAL<br> MAULUDE KAABA HAI ALI<br> MAULA KA MAULA HAI ALI<br> FARMAAGAE MERE NABI<br> <br> KHUD RIZQ PAR MAAMUR HO<br> DASTE KHUDA MASHOOR HO<br> JO BHI TUMHARA LAAL HO<br> USSE MUSIBAT DUR HO<br> PATTHAR PE GAADHA HAI ALAM<br> MOHRE NABUWAT PAR KADAM<br> KYU NA KAHU MAI DAM BA DAM<br> <br> JO MARKADE AFKAR HAI<br> USME ALI PAIDA HUA<br> JO MARKAZE ANWAAR HAI<br> USME ALI PAIDA HUE<br> JO SHAHE KHAIBAR GEER HAI<br> JISKA PISAR SHABBIR HAI<br> SHIO TUMHARA PEER HAI<br> <br> SHAHE ARAB SHAHE AJAM<br> AI MALIKE BADE ERAM<br> TERE PISAR ABBAS KI KHAAE KOI JUTHI KASAM<br> KISME HAI ITNA HAUSLAA KOI NAHI KOI NAATHAA<br> GAAZI KA BHI NAARA YEH THA<br> <br> ZAUJA TERI KHAIRUNISA<br> YANI JANABE SAYYADA<br> JISKE LIYE TATHEER KI AAYAT ME KEHTA HAI KHUDA<br> YEH MUSTUFA KA NOOR HAI<br> HAR RIZ ISSE DUR HAI<br> ISKI KHUSHI MANZOOR HAI<br> <br> KUWAT HAI US DARAIN WOH<br> BAATIL KE JO KAATE JIGAR<br> 14 SADI KE BAAD BHI<br> JAARI HAI NAARE KAA SAFAR<br> HAR JANG KE HAR MAIDAAN ME<br> BIKHRE HUE TUFAAN ME<br> SHAMIL HAI YEH IMAAN ME<br> <br> NADE ALI KA MAUJIZA <br> BATLA GAE HAI MUSTAFA<br> HAIDER KA JAB KAAM AA HI THA <br> LAB PAR YAHI TO THI SADA<br> AI JALDI AA MERE AKHI<br> HAI SAKHT MUSHKIL KI GHADI<br> KEHNE LAGE JIBREEL BHI<br> <br> HAI ISME AAZAM KI SIFAT<br> IS NAARAE BEDAAR ME<br> TEZI HAI ISME IS KADAR <br> REHTI HAI JO TALWAAR ME<br> DAR HAI DILE KUFFAAR ME<br> KARTA HAI DAR DEEWAR ME<br> HAR KUCHAO BAZAAR ME<br> <br> KHAAKE DARE SHABBIR HU<br> KADME SUKHAN KA NOOR HU<br> MADDAHE AHLEBAIT HU<br> KYA SAHIBE TAUKEER HU<br> RADDE BALA KE WAASTE<br> REHAN YEH LIKH DIJIYE<br> MEHSHAR ME BAKSHISH KE LIYE</span></span></p> 
